<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT -Dollar General is Focus One.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT -Dollar General is Focus One.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it cited Dollar General Corp as the Focus One stock.</p>
<p>-- kept the shares rated near, and long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- analyst Dan Barry not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- shares rose 1-3/4 to 31-7/8.</p>
